; Baselines: an expect literal in the test file and an expect_file
; against help.expected. The stanza runs the suite with --corrected and
; diffs each corrected file, so a stale expectation shows as a diff
; under `dune runtest` and `dune promote` accepts it — the same
; promotion protocol as for [%expect] and cram tests.

(test
 (name test_mytool)
 (modules test_mytool mytool)
 (libraries windtrap)
 (deps help.expected)
 (action
  (progn
   (run %{test} --corrected)
   (diff? test_mytool.ml test_mytool.ml.corrected)
   (diff? help.expected help.expected.corrected))))
